%N A402018 Decimal expansion of L'(1,chi_{-11})/L(1,chi_{-11}) negated, where chi_{-11} is the Dirichlet character kronecker(-11,.).
%F A402018 Equals A402011 - Sum_{a=1..10} Legendre(a,11)*log Gamma(a/11).
%e A402018 L'(1,chi_{-11})/L(1,chi_{-11}) = -0.08421830429704092509...
%o A402018 (PARI) f(D) = my(L=lfuncreate(D)); lfun(L,1,1)/lfun(L,1,0); \\ D is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402018 f(-11)
%o A402018 (PARI) f(D) = my(h = qfbclassno(D)); log(2*Pi) + Euler() - (1/h) * sum(a=1, abs(D), kronecker(D,a)*lngamma(a/abs(D))); \\ D < -4 is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402018 f(-11)
%Y A402018 Cf. A011582 (chi_{-11}). See A402011 for related sequences.
